subnapi (0.5.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * OpenSubtitles login goes over HTTPS.
  * Passwords with &, # or + work with NapiProjekt and Napisy24.
  * Subtitles without Polish letters are no longer damaged by a wrong
    encoding guess.
  * Conversion to SRT is no longer switched off by saving the settings.
  * A failed conversion no longer gives a .srt file in another format.
  * Files and folders with spaces or Polish letters open from the file
    manager.
  * Smaller fixes: Napisy24 account link, subnapic waiting forever without
    input, archives with folders, settings migration under Flatpak.

